<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel to hold news conference Wed.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel to hold news conference Wed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc said on Tuesday it would hold a news conference at its Paris head office on Wednesday at 9 a.m. (0800 GMT).</p>
<p>Co-chairmen Patrick Ponsolle and Robert Malpas will give the briefing, the company said in a statement.</p>
